# Membership summary

Members must provide a notice period of forty-five (45) days when terminating their membership, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-0476db643f1e865731a1572848a12ae27845b799 "The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received."]].

The expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense, effective from 1 October 2026 [[cite:obs-21de419d34ded93c91cd95b102d501a53062c594 "With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense."]].
